<h1 id="hero-title">From firefighting to an agentic delivery engine.</h1>
<p class="lead">A fast-built MVP was producing a steady stream of incidents that absorbed the team.</p>
<dl class="facts">
<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Fractional CTO</dd></div>
<div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Early-stage startup</dd></div>
<div><dt>Offer</dt><dd>Agentic development setup</dd></div>
</dl>
</div>
