<div class="container">
<h2 id="results-title" class="visually-hidden">Results</h2>
<dl class="figures figures--row">
<div><dt>−70%</dt><dd>production incidents. The team moved from firefighting to structured product management.</dd></div>
<div><dt>53 → 94%</dt><dd>AI message quality on the evaluation suite, tracked over time.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Daily</dt><dd>production releases, with several pre-production deployments a day.</dd></div>
</dl>
