<section class="sec--l" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="challenge-title" class="h-small">The challenge</h2>
<p class="say">The product had been built quickly to find its market. Incidents arrived faster than the team could fix them, leaving no room for planned work. The AI features, which personalise outreach messages, had no way to measure whether a change made them better or worse.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--rule" aria-labelledby="did-title">
<div class="container">
<div class="head"><h2 id="did-title">What we did</h2><p class="lead">We gave the codebase, infrastructure, process and AI features a sturdier foundation with reliable quality controls.</p></div>
<ol class="numbered numbered--4">
<li><h3>Diagnostic and roadmap</h3><p>Reviewed the codebase, servers and processes, and agreed a roadmap with the founders.</p></li>
<li><h3>An agentic SDLC</h3><p>A custom harness, automated releases, feature flags and AI observability.</p></li>
<li><h3>Repeatable evaluations</h3><p>A test suite comparing prompts, guardrails, models and LLM judges on real message samples.</p></li>
<li><h3>Product analytics</h3><p>Usage data in place, so product decisions rest on evidence.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

